{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/2f06060df82106cc89d913add17f9668.poster.avif?t=1757933699\" width=496 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/2f06060df82106cc89d913add17f9668.webm?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/2f06060df82106cc89d913add17f9668.mp4?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build, Decorate, and Stay Productive\u2014Right from Your Desktop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/8a19074510b40c3b6919cece8ac368cf.poster.avif?t=1757933699\" width=396 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/8a19074510b40c3b6919cece8ac368cf.webm?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/8a19074510b40c3b6919cece8ac368cf.mp4?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Desktown</strong> is a cozy mini-planet that lives on the bottom corner of your screen. Whether you're watching videos, working, or gaming, your little town continues to grow\u2014turning your desktop into a charming, interactive space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.poster.avif?t=1757933699\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.webm?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.mp4?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/596ad01252312cb9b0cc8ca4e00cc14f.avif?t=1757933699\" width=480 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini Planet:</strong> Minimize the planet while you work, watch videos, or play games. Stay focused and distraction-free, all while keeping an eye on your town and decorating your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Widgets:</strong> More than just a game\u2014it's a productivity tool! Use countdowns, alarms, Pomodoro timers, and other handy widgets to stay on track and manage your time effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded View:</strong> Ready to dive back in? Click the mini planet to instantly expand into a vibrant, full-screen view of your town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automators:</strong> Sit back and relax while your town runs itself. Automate key resources like Population, Food, and Knowledge to keep things growing\u2014even when you're not actively playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorations:</strong> Bring your town to life by placing decorations wherever you like. No more empty void\u2014make it uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satellites:</strong> Play word-guessing mini-games! Type the correct words to earn bursts of valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Areas:</strong> Unlock towns across different themes and eras! The demo includes 2 unique areas, while the full version unlocks all 6.\u201d</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848210?t=1757933699","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/2066e14078a79aaf642348748e65b63a143b85ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757933699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/cfa53d69907d6b2fde112332de9581959dc4a28f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757933699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/cfa53d69907d6b2fde112332de9581959dc4a28f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757933699","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3898960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/2f06060df82106cc89d913add17f9668.poster.avif?t=1757933699\" width=496 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/2f06060df82106cc89d913add17f9668.webm?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/2f06060df82106cc89d913add17f9668.mp4?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build, Decorate, and Stay Productive\u2014Right from Your Desktop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/8a19074510b40c3b6919cece8ac368cf.poster.avif?t=1757933699\" width=396 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/8a19074510b40c3b6919cece8ac368cf.webm?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/8a19074510b40c3b6919cece8ac368cf.mp4?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Desktown</strong> is a cozy mini-planet that lives on the bottom corner of your screen. Whether you're watching videos, working, or gaming, your little town continues to grow\u2014turning your desktop into a charming, interactive space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.poster.avif?t=1757933699\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.webm?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.mp4?t=1757933699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/extras/596ad01252312cb9b0cc8ca4e00cc14f.avif?t=1757933699\" width=480 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini Planet:</strong> Minimize the planet while you work, watch videos, or play games. Stay focused and distraction-free, all while keeping an eye on your town and decorating your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Widgets:</strong> More than just a game\u2014it's a productivity tool! Use countdowns, alarms, Pomodoro timers, and other handy widgets to stay on track and manage your time effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded View:</strong> Ready to dive back in? Click the mini planet to instantly expand into a vibrant, full-screen view of your town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automators:</strong> Sit back and relax while your town runs itself. Automate key resources like Population, Food, and Knowledge to keep things growing\u2014even when you're not actively playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorations:</strong> Bring your town to life by placing decorations wherever you like. No more empty void\u2014make it uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satellites:</strong> Play word-guessing mini-games! Type the correct words to earn bursts of valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Areas:</strong> Unlock towns across different themes and eras! The demo includes 2 unique areas, while the full version unlocks all 6.\u201d</p>","developers":["Deskteam"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/af73a9d7cbc21acf09e8e39f329bdba25efba8a9/header.jpg?t=1757933699","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257163033,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163033/movie480.mp4?t=1751505495","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163033/movie_max.mp4?t=1751505495"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163033/bc2b50427